---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[var(--color-bg-deeper)] text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] mt-32 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)]">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-20 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
    <div class="md:col-span-5 relative">
      <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-[3px] h-12 bg-[var(--color-brand-red)]"></span>
      <div class="pl-5">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)]">guyaga</span>
          <span class="font-display text-xl text-[var(--color-ink-primary)]" style="font-variation-settings: 'SOFT' 50, 'WONK' 1;">marketing skills</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          48 marketing skills for AI agents, in Guy Aga's voice. Ten specialists. One install. Built for marketers, founders, and operators who want their agent to actually ship work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-3 md:col-start-7">
      <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)] mb-4">Project</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/team/" class="text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors duration-200">The team</a></li>
        <li><a href="/skills/" class="text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors duration-200">All skills</a></li>
        <li><a href="/install/" class="text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors duration-200">Install</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/guyaga/marketing-skills" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors duration-200">GitHub ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)] mb-4">Built by</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href="https://guyaga.ai" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors duration-200">guyaga.ai ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://bestguy.ai" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-ink-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors duration-200">bestguy.ai ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-[var(--color-rule)]">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-7 text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-tertiary)] space-y-3">
      <p class="leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[var(--color-ink-secondary)] mr-2">On sources</span>
        Skills synthesize public marketing literature, organized by Guy Aga in his voice. Specific benchmarks cite their primary source where possible (Lavender, Instantly, Baymard, Andrew Chen, Reforge public posts, Google Search Central, Wharton JMR, etc). Numbers should be re-verified before any external citation.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)]">
        <span>© {year} Guy Aga. MIT licensed.</span>
        <span>
          Adapted with attribution from
          <a href="https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills" rel="noopener" class="underline decoration-[var(--color-rule-strong)] underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--color-brand-red)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-brand-red)] transition-colors">Corey Haines' marketing-skills</a>.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
